msgstr "机械动力：工厂控制台手册"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:4
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Create: Factory Controller introduces a new block, the \"Factory "
#| "Controller\". It allows you to place factory gauges on a virtual board "
#| "stored in a single block, instead of having a wall of gauges in the game "
#| "world. The factory gauges are managed via a GUI. The mod adds many "
#| "enhancements to factory gauges, and some other components may also be "
#| "placed in factory controllers."
msgid ""
"Create: Factory Controller provides a block called the \"`factory "
"controller`\", which allows you to place factory gauges and other components "
"on a virtual board stored inside the block. Factory gauges placed in factory "
"controllers also receive many functional enhancements."
msgstr ""
"机械动力：工厂控制台附属添加了新方块“工厂控制台”。它能够将工厂仪表放置在同一"
"个方块所保存的虚拟面板中，并通过图形界面统一管理，而无需在世界中搭建仪表墙。"
"模组还扩展了工厂仪表的功能，并支持在工厂控制台内使用一些额外组件。"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You do not need to read this manual in full to use the mod. The manual "
"serves to provide a reference to the features of the mod, especially to "
"those that are difficult to explain fully in the UI."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/index.adoc:10
